help_relevant:
Usage:
 obstack [option(s)] [pid]

Example:
 obstack $pid

Options:
 -l, --log_level=[DEBUG|INFO|WARN|ERROR]              : Log level
 -n, --no_parse                                       : Output address only
 -a, --agg                                            : Aggregate backtrace
 -s, --symbol_path=path                               : Binary path
 -d, --debuginfo_path=path                            : Debuginfo path
 -o, --no_lineno                                      : Output function name only
 -t, --thread_only                                    : Process single thread only
 -v, --version                                        : Output version number

